// You have TWO keys:
//   1. UPLOAD KEY — you keep, use to sign the AAB you upload to Play
//   2. APP SIGNING KEY — Google keeps, signs the split APKs delivered to users

// Benefits:
//   - Losing your upload key is recoverable (Google resets after verification)
//   - Losing the signing key is NOT recoverable — but Google keeps it safe
//   - Rotate upload key freely; app signing key stays stable
//   - Enroll new apps automatically

// Enroll: Play Console → App integrity → Play App Signing → Enroll.
